GT-centered oracle validation，270 test未访问。

## 全自动brain-crop locator / CAPG-3D（2026-08-14）

| output | plain scan | CAPG scan | CAPG−plain | plain subject | CAPG subject |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| locator | `0.716125` | `0.719090` | `+0.002965` | `0.706215` | `0.710459` |
| SAM dense-only | `0.596964` | `0.595425` | `-0.001540` | `0.600584` | `0.600045` |
| SAM point+dense | `0.599324` | `0.597910` | `-0.001414` | `0.601878` | `0.601175` |

CAPG locator subject差CI为`[-0.003736,+0.013624]`；预注册主指标SAM point+dense
subject差为`-0.000703`，CI `[-0.004178,+0.002713]`，未过`+0.005`。CAPG中心点hit
`0.638889`，plain segmentation argmax hit `0.935185`，中心头无收益。直接locator是当前
